      "source": "handbook-wypych-2016",
      "conditions": "Semi-crystalline; degree of crystallinity is strongly processing-dependent (amorphous/clear in quenched bottle-grade PET vs. more crystalline/opaque in fiber or engineering grades). Oriented fiber ≈52.5-54.6%, oriented film up to 85%."
